<view class="page profile-page">
  <view class="header-block">
    <text class="title">👩👨 双人档案</text>
    <text class="subtitle">身高、体重和目标都可以修改。数据只保存在当前设备的微信中。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="status-card status-card--error" wx:if="{{pageError}}">
    <text>⚠️ {{pageError}}</text>
    <button wx:if="{{loadFailed}}" class="retry-button" bindtap="onRetryLoad" disabled="{{busy}}">重新读取</button>
    <block wx:if="{{loadFailed}}">
      <text class="recovery-note">如果反复读取失败，可以清除这台设备上的档案、偏好、菜单历史和购物勾选后重新开始。</text>
      <button class="retry-button recovery-clear-button" bindtap="onClearData" disabled="{{busy}}">清除本地数据并重新开始</button>
    </block>
  </view>
  <view class="card loading-card" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在读取本地档案…</view>

  <view class="card backup-card" wx:if="{{!loading}}">
    <text class="backup-card__title">📦 离线备份（可选）</text>
    <text class="backup-card__text">把最近一次已保存的档案、偏好、菜单历史和购物勾选复制成一段本地文本。换手机时手动复制到新设备，再从剪贴板恢复；内容不会上传服务器。</text>
    <view class="backup-actions">
      <button class="backup-button" bindtap="onExportBackup" disabled="{{busy}}">复制本地备份</button>
      <button class="backup-button backup-button--secondary" bindtap="onImportBackup" disabled="{{busy}}">从剪贴板恢复</button>
    </view>
    <text class="backup-card__warning">备份文本包含身高、体重和饮食记录，请勿粘贴到公开或不信任的地方。</text>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{!loading && !loadFailed}}">
    <view class="card setup-note">
      <text class="setup-note__title">先核对两个人的实际数据</text>
      <text>首次预填的称呼、身高和体重只是示例。修改后请点底部“保存档案”；已有菜单会保留，回到“今日”可按新设置重算。</text>
    </view>
    <view id="profile-member-{{profileIndex}}" class="card member-card" wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="profile" wx:for-index="profileIndex">
      <view class="member-heading">
        <text class="member-title">{{profile.emoji}} 第 {{profileIndex + 1}} 位成员</text>
        <text class="member-subtitle">每个人的档案和目标独立计算</text>
      </view>

      <view class="field-block">
        <view class="field">
          <text class="field__label">称呼</text>
          <input
            class="field__control {{profile.errors.name ? 'field__control--error' : ''}}"
            value="{{profile.name}}"
            data-index="{{profileIndex}}"
            data-field="name"
            bindinput="onDraftInput"
            disabled="{{busy}}"
            confirm-type="done"
            cursor-spacing="140"
            adjust-position="{{true}}"
            maxlength="12"
            placeholder="如：喵喵"
          />
        </view>
        <text class="field-error" wx:if="{{profile.errors.name}}">{{profile.errors.name}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="field-block">
        <view class="field">
          <text class="field__label">身高</text>
          <view class="number-control {{profile.errors.heightCm ? 'number-control--error' : ''}}">
            <input
              class="number-control__input"
              type="digit"
              value="{{profile.heightCm}}"
              data-index="{{profileIndex}}"
              data-field="heightCm"
              bindinput="onDraftInput"
              disabled="{{busy}}"
              confirm-type="done"
              cursor-spacing="140"
              adjust-position="{{true}}"
              maxlength="6"
              placeholder="100–230"
            />
            <text class="number-control__unit">cm</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text class="field-error" wx:if="{{profile.errors.heightCm}}">{{profile.errors.heightCm}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="field-block">
        <view class="field">
          <text class="field__label">体重</text>
          <view class="number-control {{profile.errors.weightKg ? 'number-control--error' : ''}}">
            <input
              class="number-control__input"
              type="digit"
              value="{{profile.weightKg}}"
              data-index="{{profileIndex}}"
              data-field="weightKg"
              bindinput="onDraftInput"
              disabled="{{busy}}"
              confirm-type="done"
              cursor-spacing="140"
              adjust-position="{{true}}"
              maxlength="6"
              placeholder="30–300"
            />
            <text class="number-control__unit">kg</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text class="field-error" wx:if="{{profile.errors.weightKg}}">{{profile.errors.weightKg}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="field-block">
        <view class="field">
          <text class="field__label">年龄</text>
          <view class="number-control {{profile.errors.ageYears ? 'number-control--error' : ''}}">
            <input
              class="number-control__input"
              type="number"
              value="{{profile.ageYears}}"
              data-index="{{profileIndex}}"
              data-field="ageYears"
              bindinput="onDraftInput"
              disabled="{{busy}}"
              confirm-type="done"
              cursor-spacing="140"
              adjust-position="{{true}}"
              maxlength="3"
              placeholder="16–100"
            />
            <text class="number-control__unit">岁</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text class="field-error" wx:if="{{profile.errors.ageYears}}">{{profile.errors.ageYears}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="field-block field-block--picker">
        <text class="picker-label">日常活动量</text>
        <picker
          mode="selector"
          range="{{activityOptions}}"
          range-key="label"
          value="{{profile.activityIndex}}"
          data-index="{{profileIndex}}"
          bindchange="onActivityChange"
          disabled="{{busy}}"
        >
          <view class="picker-control">
            <view class="picker-control__content">
              <text class="picker-control__value">{{profile.activityLabel}}</text>
              <text class="picker-control__description">{{profile.activityDescription}}</text>
            </view>
            <text class="picker-control__arrow">›</text>
          </view>
        </picker>
      </view>

      <view class="field-block field-block--picker">
        <text class="picker-label">目标强度</text>
        <picker
          mode="selector"
          range="{{targetOptions}}"
          range-key="label"
          value="{{profile.targetIndex}}"
          data-index="{{profileIndex}}"
          bindchange="onTargetChange"
          disabled="{{busy}}"
        >
          <view class="picker-control">
            <view class="picker-control__content">
              <text class="picker-control__value">{{profile.targetLabel}}</text>
              <text class="picker-control__description">{{profile.targetDescription}}</text>
            </view>
            <text class="picker-control__arrow">›</text>
          </view>
        </picker>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="save-panel">
      <text class="unsaved-message" wx:if="{{hasUnsavedChanges}}">有修改尚未保存</text>
      <text class="save-hint" wx:elif="{{!savedMessage}}">修改完成后，在这里保存两人的档案</text>
      <button
        class="save-button {{saveDisabled ? 'save-button--disabled' : ''}}"
        bindtap="onSave"
        loading="{{busy}}"
        disabled="{{saveDisabled}}"
      >{{busy ? '正在处理…' : '保存档案'}}</button>
      <text class="saved-message" wx:if="{{savedMessage}}">{{savedMessage}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="card notice">
      活动量用于估算每天消耗，目标强度用于设置热量范围。结果仅供日常健身饮食参考，不替代医生或注册营养师建议。若当前目标无法用本地模板组合成日常份量，小程序会停止生成并提示核对；修改档案后，已有菜单不会被自动替换。
    </view>
    <button class="clear-button {{busy ? 'clear-button--disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onClearData" disabled="{{busy}}">清除这台设备上的全部数据</button>
  </block>
</view>
